msgid ""
"Select the metric unit for wind speed to be used for wind displays. This has "
"no effect on the imperial unit 'mph'."
msgstr ""
"Vælg den metriske enhed for vindhastighed, der skal bruges til visning af "
"vind. Dette har ingen effekt på den imperiale enhed 'mph'."

msgid "Select the preferred weather service to supply the weather information."
msgstr "Vælg den foretrukne vejrservice til at levere vejrinformationen."

msgid "Select the temperature unit to be used for temperature displays."
msgstr "Vælg den temperaturenhed, der skal bruges til temperaturvisning."

msgid ""
"Select this option to save that last obtained weather data locally. This is "
"used to initialize the data immediately after restart while updated data is "
"being fetched."
msgstr ""
"Vælg denne indstilling for at gemme de senest hentede vejrdata lokalt. Dette "
"bruges til at initialisere dataene straks efter genstart, mens opdaterede "
"data hentes."

