msgstr "Sydvest"

msgid ""
"Specify how often Weather retrieves its data from the server. 'Once' means "
"the data will loaded only once after a GUI or system start."
msgstr ""
"Angiv, hvor ofte Vejr henter sine data fra serveren. 'Én gang' betyder, at "
"dataene kun indlæses én gang efter en GUI- eller systemstart."

